@deepseek-ai/dsh-plugin-canvas README · Introduction：<p>For the sandbox rendering, the plugin automatically routes all iframe content through a secure sandbox. You don't need to do anything special — just enjoy the extra safety.</p>

<h2>🛠️ System Requirements</h2>

<p>This plugin is designed for Windows 10 or 11 (64‑bit). You also need <strong>DeepSeek Harness</strong> already installed on your computer. If you don't have DSH, you can get it from the official DeepSeek website.</p>

@deepseek-ai/dsh-plugin-canvas README · Introduction：<h2>🧑‍💻 For Developers (Brief)</h2>

<p>If you're familiar with coding, the plugin is built on the DSH plugin API. It registers a new tab and a custom model tool named <code>canvas_preview</code>. You can fork the repo and modify the UI to your liking. The code is clean and well‑commented.</p>

<h2>📦 How to Update</h2>

